      "title": "模型设置 / Model setup",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 模型设置 / Model setup\n\n主模型与视觉投影放在同一模型目录，可使用来源子目录避免同名投影混淆。\nPlace the main model and matching projector under the model directory; source subfolders can separate identically named projectors.\n\n`ComfyUI/models/LLM/Qwen3.8/`\n\n示例预选 Unsloth 主模型与投影；请改为实际安装的配对文件。\nThe example selects the Unsloth pair; choose the matching files actually installed.\n\n- Main model: `Qwen3.8-27B-UD-Q4_K_M.gguf`\n- Projector: `mmproj-BF16.gguf`\n\n模型加载器 → 本地多模态对话 → 文本预览\nModel Loader → Local Multimodal Chat → Preview as Text\n\n运行对话时才加载权重。API 对话直接输出文本，不接此加载器。\nWeights load when chat runs. API Chat returns text directly and does not use this loader.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#243447",
      "bgcolor": "#31465c"
    },
